WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.710
The massive ship rising in the sky
above Midchilda, the Holy King’s Cradle.<i></i>

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:11.610
If we allow it to reach orbit,
then everyone on Mid will be a hostage.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.910
Incredible danger is upon us,

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:18.060
and every member of Riot Force 6 is involved.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.940
Captain Fate heads for Scaglietti’s hideout.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.860
The forwards head for the combat cyborgs on the surface.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:30.090
And the two officers of Stars head inside the <i>Cradle</i>.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:36.080
We have a little over two hours left.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:05.960
The things that I can do for you and no one else

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:11.660
I honestly feel and wish for those

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.380
I am frozen by uncertainties

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:24.620
By the rules I have been relying on

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:30.320
My past embellished with excuses

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.520
I want to get over it

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.800
Staining the stars in heaven scarlet

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.270
Gather the grains of miracles

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.530
Before the still, unseen night

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.810
I want to tell you that I am escaping from illusions

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.990
The twilight moon calls out to me

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.080
Removing my veil of delusions

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.290
My hidden, deceitful self

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.170
And took all of my weaknesses

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.630
I don’t want words that seem passionate

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:17.050
The fact that I’m here right now is my truth

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:34.340
Quattro, can I give my honest opinion?

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.090
Go right ahead.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.580
I don’t really like this plan.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.390
Why is that?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:52.230
Do we really have to stoop to using
such a small girl to power such a huge ship?

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.860
I’m not really sure about this “engineer’s revenge.”

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.490
Oh, that.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.510
That’s just the Doctor’s excuse.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.130
Doesn’t mean a thing.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:02.320
Really?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.860
The Doctor’s always had one goal:

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.210
The completion of biomanipulation technology

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.820
and a space to do that.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:16.790
The <i>Cradle</i> is here to make that dream a reality.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.200
Well, I’m sure a minimum of
several thousand people are going to die here,

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:24.630
but it won’t even take a hundred years to make up for that.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:28.810
The Doctor’s research is there to save people!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.470
What’s wrong, Dieci?

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:38.100
Have you stopped believing in your big sister and the Doctor?

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.610
No, that’s not it.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.230
Not at all, but...

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:49.120
...but, when I see such a weak, small life,
living and moving like this,

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:53.830
I think that maybe they don’t have anything to do with it.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:58.750
Before you saw them,
you could easily pull the trigger, right?

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:02.460
Sorry, I just got distracted for a second.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:03.710
Forget it.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.990
Really?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:09.140
I’ll do as I was ordered.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:15.480
If I don’t, it’ll be bad for my sisters on the ground.

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:25.280
Stupid Dieci, you’re a boring girl like Cinque and Sein.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:39.000
A weak life that can’t do anything is no different than an insect’s.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:44.860
No matter how many you kill, more will just keep being born.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:47.740
Playing with them and abusing them,

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:53.060
throwing them in a cage and watching them suffer

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.030
is so much fun!

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.480
Right?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:15.330
The massive ship which rose from the mountains of central Midchilda continues to ascend.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:20.450
At the same time, gadgets and a group that is being considered dangerous

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:23.980
are heading toward the capital, Cranagan, from the 7th Abandoned City Area.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:27.510
An emergency evacuation order
has been issued for the surrounding area.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:34.540
We ask that all citizens remain calm and follow the orders of any Bureau operatives as well as the safety broadcasts.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.470
Are you awake?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.000
Just woke up.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.320
What day is today? What time is it?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:46.030
How many days did I sleep?

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.490
It’s been a full week since Riot Force 6 was attacked.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.980
It seems a new incident has occurred.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:56.210
Everyone in Riot Force 6 who can move is deployed.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.150
Without a chopper?

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:01.130
Damn! At a time like this, I...

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.800
Alto is piloting the helicopter.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:10.180
Signum and Alto told me.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.640
Laguna.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:17.560
And they said you were hurt,
and I should go see you since you’re my brother.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.480
Are you okay, Vice?

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:24.950
I hear your wounds are nothing major.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:28.060
If you just stay in the hospital, they’ll heal right away.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:29.180
That’s right.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:33.120
You know, about that time...

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:43.210
After that, you and I never really spoke,

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:47.170
but I was hoping we could go back to how we used to be.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.860
My left eye

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.260
is fine now.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.080
They said I won’t have to wear an eyepatch anymore.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:05.260
You’re a visitor?

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.140
You need to hurry up and evacuate,

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:09.770
and somebody will be here for the patients soon.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:12.260
Please wait until then.

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:17.940
Once you’re better, can we talk like we used to?

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:20.700
I’m sorry, you’ll have to talk after the evacuation.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.170
Vice, I...

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:29.950
What a pathetic story.

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:34.070
I ran from my failure, my responsibility!

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:36.280
I still haven’t faced them.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:39.930
I screwed up again, and I’m like this.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.130
I haven’t gotten over anything.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:45.640
I can’t even look Laguna in the eyes.

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:49.240
I can’t hold her, Storm Raider, in my hands.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:57.930
How you live and how you fight is for you to decide.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:06.920
Alto and the others asked me to watch you until you woke up, but that’s done now.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.380
Hey, where are you going all beat up like that?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.990
There’s something I must do.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:16.530
Hey!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.850
Storm Raider.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:32.670
Just tell us why you’re fighting already!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.190
If you don’t,

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.530
we’ll all really...

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.100
The Doctor asked me to.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:43.560
<b>Wing Shooter</b>

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:06.840
The Doctor is helping me find what I’m looking for,
the Relic with Serial No. XI.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:10.320
So I do what he asks.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.860
For something like that?

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.580
For something like that.

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:26.270
It might not be much to you, but it is to me.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.700
No, no!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.670
Not like that!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.620
Zest will be gone soon.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.090
Agito will go somewhere too, I’m sure.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:45.060
But when the main event is over, the Doctor,
Uno, and the others will look for Serial No. XI for me.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.630
Then my mom will come back.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:52.110
Then I won’t be unhappy anymore.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:52.890
No!

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.540
That’s not true!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.820
I don’t like talking to you.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.340
That’s not true!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:23.560
If you want to be happy, no matter how unhappy
you are, you can’t make others unhappy or hurt them!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:29.480
If you do that, you won’t find what you want, especially happiness!

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:37.980
I’m a dragon summoner from Alzus
and a mage with the Bureau’s Riot Force 6.

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.740
Caro Ru Lushe!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:40.870
And with the same,

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.320
Erio Mondial.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.790
And the flying dragon, Friedrich.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:50.990
Tell us about how you’re looking for the Relics and your mother!

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:55.330
We, Riot Force 6, will help you!

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:57.510
What’s your name?

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:04.710
Oh, that’s a no-no, Miss Lutecia.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:06.310
You too, Galue.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:12.650
You mustn’t listen to the enemy in the middle of a battle.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:17.060
If something gets in your way, kill it and keep going!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:19.950
That’s how you use our power!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:25.560
We have a lot of work for you to do after this, Miss Lu.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:31.580
We need you to cut off the city’s lifelines and smash their defensive base.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.130
Quattro. But...

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.380
You’re hesitating, aren’t you?

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:44.600
To a pure, innocent girl like you,
Miss Lutecia, that child’s words are poison.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.990
And so, <i>press!</i>

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.620
Lu!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.690
Galue! What is this?

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:13.670
I made it so Miss Lu won’t hesitate anymore.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:19.090
This is a consideration console that the Doctor implanted in her.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:24.930
I presented her with a stone heart
that won’t listen to anybody.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:34.730
Miss!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.150
Can you hear me?

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:39.760
The ones in front of you are your enemies.

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:43.780
If you don’t use all your power to kill them,
you’ll never see your mother.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:44.660
Why you!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:50.740
Insects, Jirai-Oh, Galue...

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.480
Kill.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.380
Kill them.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.800
Kill them!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.680
Galue!

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.450
<b>I.S.: Slaughter Arms</b>

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.460
Thunder Arm

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.840
The A.M.F. is slowing me down.

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:23.400
I need to defeat them quickly and go on ahead,

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.640
but I can’t use Sonic or Riot.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:31.390
If I use them now, I won’t be able to use them later.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:35.870
If I can’t get to Scaglietti, it’s game over,

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:40.940
and even if I do<i> capture him,
I won’t be able to help the others.</i>

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:48.240
Oh, how are you doing, Enforcer Fate Testarossa?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.530
Scaglietti!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:57.740
The legacy of F and the dragon summoner
who are fighting my works,

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.130
can you hear me?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:06.140
The first part of our wonderful main event is at its climax.

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:09.250
What do you mean, “wonderful main event?”

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:12.340
You’re a felon who’s plunged the surface into chaos!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:14.040
Felon?

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:18.050
Do you mean the Artificial Mage or Combat Cyborg Projects?

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:27.680
Or do you mean the basis for Project F that I designed and your mother, Presea Testarossa, completed?

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.050
All of it.

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:35.000
In every era, revolutionaries are despised.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:40.100
You callous...! You play with people’s fates and lives...

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:45.420
I haven’t destroyed valuable ingredients
or killed without reason.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:51.780
I just turned useless, worthless lives into valuable experimental subjects.

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:56.240
Why, you...!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.240
It’s coming!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:57.640
Right!

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:23.860
Normally gentle and calm
but loses herself easily to anger or sadness.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:31.130
Oh cr—

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:43.100
That personality of yours is truly from your mother,

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.060
Fate Testarossa.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.500
Fate!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.400
Lævateinn!

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.060
Snake Form

00:16:58.340 --> 00:16:59.680
<b>Flame Acceleration</b>

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:06.310
<b>Draconic Swordflash</b>

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.290
<b>Flame Purge</b>

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.530
<b>Shock Acceleration</b>

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.990
Dammit.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.700
We haven’t lost them.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.800
We can chase them!

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:37.520
Yes.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.770
Sir.

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:43.400
Sorry, Agito.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:48.750
Even under Unison, I can barely use your flame anymore.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.320
I don’t care.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:54.180
I’ve got a lot of ways to protect you, sir.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.100
She called herself Signum, right?

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.820
She’s a good knight.

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.880
With such sword skills and firepower,

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:05.560
she’s a suitable candidate for being the ideal Lord you spoke of.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.760
W-What’s that?

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:12.480
Her stance was definitely
that of a true Ancient Belkan knight.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:16.910
It’s likely that she was preserved like you.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.120
That can’t be!

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:21.220
Why would somebody like that be in the Bureau?

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:24.700
Even her magic color matches yours.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.120
Which means it’s possible...

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.570
Stop it!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.170
She’s an enemy!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:34.120
Please, don’t think about me.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:37.970
Do your best for yourself.

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:04.350
Blitz Caliber, no response.

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:08.150
Her A.I. unit’s been messed with.

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:10.920
Ginny... I have to hurry.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:15.160
I’ll save Ginny and everyone.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.620
Load Cartridge

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.300
<b>Revolver...</b>

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:52.540
<b>...Cannon</b>

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.720
Ginny...

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:13.530
Ginny.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.520
Ginny!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:35.420
We were able to use D.N.A. analysis to discover when the person Vivio was cloned from was born.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:40.910
Her D.N.A. is from Ancient Belka, 300 years ago,
during the age of the Holy King.

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.960
I’m sure that Vivio’s mom lived in that age, which means...

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:48.390
She’s not around anymore.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:56.490
But it seems like Vivio thinks a mom
is somebody who’s especially gentle to her.

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:59.560
But she’s really taken to you.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:02.430
Are you going to adopt her as your daughter?

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:04.780
I’m looking for a place that will take her in.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:10.200
A warm family who will accept her and who needs her.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.170
She won’t like that.

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:16.670
I don’t think I can make her happy.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:17.660
Why not?

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:26.090
I’m always busy with myself,
and I don’t have the right to be a gentle mother.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:30.760
And more than anything, I’m a person of the sky.

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.050
You can’t say that!

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:36.180
It’s a possiblity.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:38.240
I’ve been shot down once already.

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:39.400
But still!

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:44.240
Mama.

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:47.060
Vivio, what’s wrong?

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:49.600
You look sad, Mama.

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:51.720
Really?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.750
Mama, be a good girl.

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:01.670
You’re so sweet, Vivio.

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:04.370
I’m fine.

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:10.970
As long as you’re happy and smiling, Vivio,
Mama Nanoha will always be happy and smiling too.

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:27.790
I can’t fight every one of them.

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:29.610
Raising Heart!

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:30.560
All right.

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:31.930
Strike Flame

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:37.530
<b>A.C.S. Driver</b>

00:22:37.530 --> 00:22:38.350
Charge.

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:52.810
It’s no use, Quattro. I can’t handle her.

00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:55.560
That’s as we thought.

00:22:55.560 --> 00:23:00.500
She’s going to die here in the throne room.

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:09.290
They’re all doing better than we thought,
but it’s just a matter of time.

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:18.040
We just have to stand here and wait.

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:24.380
The <i>Cradle</i> will reach

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:25.050
orbit in

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:25.490
1

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:25.830
1 hour

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:26.870
1 hour and 44 minutes

00:25:16.740 --> 00:25:19.540
My own battle
that I can’t run from.

00:25:19.540 --> 00:25:22.120
The strength I admired,
that I truly longed for.

00:25:22.120 --> 00:25:26.120
It’s always the courage to step forward that brings victory.

00:25:32.080 --> 00:25:35.990
With heart, take off!
